==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-bonk.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/bɒŋk/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɒŋk|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}
{{slim-wikipedia|Hitting the wall|Bonk}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} To [[strike]] or [[collide]] with something.
# {{lb|en|informal|chiefly|UK}} To have [[sexual intercourse]].
# {{lb|en|skateboarding}} To hit something with the front wheels of the skateboard, whilst in the air, this pre-dates the snowboarding term,
# {{lb|en|snowboarding}} To hit something (especially a tree) with one's snowboard, especially while in the air.
# {{lb|en|informal}} To experience sudden and severe [[fatigue]] in an endurance sports event due to [[glycogen]] depletion.

